# Fungus1_21 from the drop in the top hall (x 9, y 54) down through its tiers to the west gate (x 0, y 12 to 16) into Fungus1_04.
# Planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc (HK_WALKPLAN_MARGIN=0.4, sync poll) with the whole run before it as the pre, 2026-11-03.
at 9.00 54.00
walk 10.38
drop 13.70 44.39
fight 4 2.75 15.69
snipe
guard 2
retreat 2.75 15.69
heal
loop c21-h002 until expr abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_X) - 1342177) <= 58982 && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 2637169) <= 19661 max 3 timeout 900
walk 15.64
walk 15.21   # run-up
walk 15.64   # take-off
hold right+cross for 8
hold right for 27
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
end
